## API reference

### Navigation

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` | `:pill`, `:line`, `:indicator` | `:pill` | How the current / hovered link is drawn; `:indicator` is for vertical sidebars. |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Link text, padding and icons. |
| `orientation:` | `:horizontal`, `:vertical` | `:horizontal` | A row or a column. |
| `active_link:` | `String`, `Symbol` | - | The `value:` of the current link. |
| `aria_label:` | `String` | - | Name the landmark. |

### NavigationLink

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value:` | `String`, `Symbol` | - | Matched against `active_link:`. |
| `active:` | `Boolean` | - | Current, overriding `active_link:`. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Dimmed and out of the tab order. |
| `indicator:` | `Symbol`, `Proc` | chevron | The `:indicator` variant's marker. |
| `variant:`, `size:`, `orientation:` | | root's | Per-link overrides. |

A block that takes an argument receives the attributes (Appica's `render` prop) - put them on a `<button>` or your
own link. `NavigationList` is the `<ul>`, `NavigationItem` an `<li>`.

## Accessibility

- A `<nav>` landmark - give it an `aria_label:` so several navs are distinguishable.
- The current link is `aria-current="page"`; disabled links are `aria-disabled` and skipped by Tab.
- Hover and current transitions are skipped under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
